{"seq":3,"slug":"bandwidth-optimization","title":"带宽优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking/bandwidth-optimization","wordCount":1681,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"带宽优化\">带宽优化</h1><p>游戏服务器的带宽是硬约束——每增加一个玩家的每秒数据量，就直接减少了单台服务器能承载的最大玩家数。带宽优化的目标是在不损失必要信息的前提下，将每玩家每秒的数据量压缩到最小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>带宽优化是一条多级压缩流水线：<strong>AOI 过滤</strong>（只发送相关实体）→ <strong>Delta 编码</strong>（只发送变化部分）→ <strong>量化</strong>（浮点降为定点）→ <strong>位打包</strong>（消除字节对齐浪费）→ <strong>熵编码</strong>（通用压缩）。每层叠加后可实现 20-60 倍压缩比，将未优化的 200 KB/s 每玩家降至 3-10 KB/s。发送频率可独立于 Tick Rate 降低，客户端用插值弥补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"带宽预算分析\">带宽预算分析</h2><p>一个 64Hz 的竞技 FPS，每 Tick 向每个玩家发送一个世界快照。如果不做优化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据项</th>\n<th>每实体大小</th>\n<th>64 个实体</th>\n<th>64Hz 频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>位置 (3×float32)</td>\n<td>12 bytes</td>\n<td>768 B</td>\n<td>49,152 B/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旋转 (quaternion)</td>\n<td>16 bytes</td>\n<td>1024 B</td>\n<td>65,536 B/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度 (3×float32)</td>\n<td>12 bytes</td>\n<td>768 B</td>\n<td>49,152 B/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态标志</td>\n<td>4 bytes</td>\n<td>256 B</td>\n<td>16,384 B/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>合计</strong></td>\n<td>44 bytes</td>\n<td>2816 B</td>\n<td><strong>180 KB/s</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>加上包头和协议开销，未优化的状态下单个玩家上行+下行可能达到 200-300 KB/s。对于 100 人的大逃杀服务器，这意味着 20-30 MB/s 的下行带宽——超出大多数服务器网卡的实际吞吐能力。</p>\n<p>优化目标：将每玩家带宽压缩到 <strong>3-10 KB/s</strong>，即压缩比 20-60 倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"delta-压缩\">Delta 压缩</h2><p>Delta 压缩是带宽优化中收益最大的单一技术。原理：不发送完整状态，只发送相对于上一个<strong>已确认快照</strong>的变化部分。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 服务器&#10;        S100[快照 Tick=100 完整状态]&#10;        S101[快照 Tick=101]&#10;        S102[快照 Tick=102]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 发送内容&#10;        D1[&quot;Delta(101-100): 只有变化的字段&quot;]&#10;        D2[&quot;Delta(102-100): 累积变化&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    S100 --&gt; D1&#10;    S101 --&gt; D1&#10;    S100 --&gt; D2&#10;    S102 --&gt; D2&#10;    subgraph 客户端&#10;        ACK[&quot;已确认: Tick=100&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    ACK -.-&gt;|&quot;基准帧&quot;| D2\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 服务器\n        S100[快照 Tick=100 完整状态]\n        S101[快照 Tick=101]\n        S102[快照 Tick=102]\n    end\n    subgraph 发送内容\n        D1[\"Delta(101-100): 只有变化的字段\"]\n        D2[\"Delta(102-100): 累积变化\"]\n    end\n    S100 --&gt; D1\n    S101 --&gt; D1\n    S100 --&gt; D2\n    S102 --&gt; D2\n    subgraph 客户端\n        ACK[\"已确认: Tick=100\"]\n    end\n    ACK -.-&gt;|\"基准帧\"| D2</pre><p><strong>关键设计决策</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策点</th>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>权衡</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Delta 基准</td>\n<td>上一个被客户端 ACK 的快照</td>\n<td>保证客户端一定有基准帧可参考</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未 ACK 时退化</td>\n<td>每 N 帧发送一次关键帧（全量）</td>\n<td>防止长时间丢包后无法恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变化检测粒度</td>\n<td>字段级别</td>\n<td>精确但需要逐字段比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位域标记</td>\n<td>用 bitmask 标记哪些字段变了</td>\n<td>固定 overhead 换取可变节省</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Delta 压缩对静态或缓变实体效果极佳——一个站着不动的 NPC，Delta 数据量为 0。对于快速移动的战斗中玩家，位置每帧都变但旋转和状态可能不变，仍能节省 40-60% 带宽。</p>\n<h2 id=\"兴趣区域管理-aoi\">兴趣区域管理（AOI）</h2><p>不是每个玩家都需要知道世界中所有实体的状态。兴趣区域管理（Area of Interest）根据距离和可见性过滤发送给每个客户端的实体集合。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>AOI 策略</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定半径</td>\n<td>以玩家为中心的圆形区域</td>\n<td>开放世界、大逃杀</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视锥体裁剪</td>\n<td>只发送视野范围内的实体</td>\n<td>FPS（正前方最重要）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网格分区</td>\n<td>世界划分为固定网格，只同步相邻网格</td>\n<td>MMO、沙盒</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态优先级</td>\n<td>近处高频更新，远处低频更新</td>\n<td>所有实时游戏</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>动态优先级 AOI</strong> 是最先进的方案：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Priority</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>type</mtext></msub><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mtext>changeRate</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Priority}(e) = \\frac{w_{\\text{type}}}{d(player, e)^2} \\times \\text{changeRate}(e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Priority</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0436em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">type</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">changeRate</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每个 Tick 按优先级排序所有实体，从高到低发送直到填满当前 Tick 的带宽预算。结果是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>近距离敌人：每 Tick 都更新（64Hz）</li>\n<li>中距离实体：每 2-4 Tick 更新一次（16-32Hz）</li>\n<li>远距离背景：每 10+ Tick 更新一次（&lt;6Hz）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"量化与位打包\">量化与位打包</h2><p>浮点数的 32 位表示对于大多数游戏状态来说精度过剩。量化将值映射到更少的位数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据</th>\n<th>原始大小</th>\n<th>量化方案</th>\n<th>量化后大小</th>\n<th>精度损失</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>位置 X/Y</td>\n<td>32 bit float</td>\n<td>地图范围内 16-bit 定点</td>\n<td>16 bit</td>\n<td>±0.5 单位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置 Z (高度)</td>\n<td>32 bit float</td>\n<td>12-bit 定点</td>\n<td>12 bit</td>\n<td>±1 单位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旋转 (yaw)</td>\n<td>32 bit float</td>\n<td>0-360° 映射到 8-bit</td>\n<td>8 bit</td>\n<td>±0.7°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>32 bit float</td>\n<td>10-bit 有符号</td>\n<td>10 bit</td>\n<td>±0.5 m/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命值</td>\n<td>32 bit int</td>\n<td>8-bit (0-255)</td>\n<td>8 bit</td>\n<td>无损（范围限制）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>量化公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>quantized</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{quantized} = \\text{round}\\left(\\frac{value - min}{max - min} \\times (2^{bits} - 1)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">quantized</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">min</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>反量化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>value</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mtext>quantized</mtext><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{value} = min + \\frac{\\text{quantized}}{2^{bits} - 1} \\times (max - min)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">value</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7751em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">quantized</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">min</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>位打包（Bit Packing）</strong>：量化后的值不再对齐到字节边界，使用位流（bitstream）连续写入，无间隙排列。一个实体的完整位打包状态可能从 352 bit（44 bytes）压缩到 80-120 bit（10-15 bytes）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"快照压缩流水线\">快照压缩流水线</h2><p>完整的带宽优化流水线按顺序应用以下技术：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Full[完整世界状态] --&gt; AOI[1. AOI 过滤: 移除不相关实体]&#10;    AOI --&gt; Delta[2. Delta 编码: 只保留变化字段]&#10;    Delta --&gt; Quant[3. 量化: 浮点→定点/整数]&#10;    Quant --&gt; BitPack[4. 位打包: 消除对齐浪费]&#10;    BitPack --&gt; Entropy[5. 熵编码: Huffman/LZ4 通用压缩]&#10;    Entropy --&gt; Send[发送: 3-10 KB/s per player]\">flowchart TD\n    Full[完整世界状态] --&gt; AOI[1. AOI 过滤: 移除不相关实体]\n    AOI --&gt; Delta[2. Delta 编码: 只保留变化字段]\n    Delta --&gt; Quant[3. 量化: 浮点→定点/整数]\n    Quant --&gt; BitPack[4. 位打包: 消除对齐浪费]\n    BitPack --&gt; Entropy[5. 熵编码: Huffman/LZ4 通用压缩]\n    Entropy --&gt; Send[发送: 3-10 KB/s per player]</pre><p>每一层的典型压缩比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化步骤</th>\n<th>压缩比</th>\n<th>累积效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AOI 过滤</td>\n<td>50-80% 实体被过滤</td>\n<td>原始 → 20-50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Delta 编码</td>\n<td>变化部分通常 30-50%</td>\n<td>→ 10-25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量化</td>\n<td>2-3× 压缩</td>\n<td>→ 4-12%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位打包</td>\n<td>1.5-2× 压缩</td>\n<td>→ 2-8%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>熵编码</td>\n<td>1.2-1.5× 压缩</td>\n<td>→ 1.5-6%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最终结果：200 KB/s 的原始数据被压缩到 3-12 KB/s。</p>\n<h2 id=\"发送频率与插值缓冲\">发送频率与插值缓冲</h2><p>服务器 Tick Rate 和实际发送频率（Send Rate）可以解耦：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Send Rate</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mtext>Tick Rate</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Send Rate} \\leq \\text{Tick Rate}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Send Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Tick Rate</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>服务器以 128Hz 模拟但以 64Hz 或 32Hz 发送快照是常见配置。客户端使用插值在两个快照之间平滑渲染：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>render</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>snap_N</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>snap_N+1</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>snap_N</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{render}}(t) = P_{\\text{snap\\_N}} + (P_{\\text{snap\\_N+1}} - P_{\\text{snap\\_N}}) \\times \\frac{t - t_N}{t_{N+1} - t_N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">render</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">snap_N</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">snap_N+1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">snap_N</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1864em;vertical-align:-0.8943em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>降低 Send Rate 线性减少带宽，代价是客户端插值缓冲区需要更大（更&quot;活在过去&quot;），对射击手感有轻微影响。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自适应带宽控制\">自适应带宽控制</h2><p>网络条件不是静态的。服务器应根据每个连接的实际情况动态调整：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>网络状况</th>\n<th>服务器响应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>丢包率上升</td>\n<td>降低 Send Rate，增加关键帧频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RTT 上升</td>\n<td>扩大 Delta 基准窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带宽充裕</td>\n<td>提高 AOI 半径，增加更新频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端降级请求</td>\n<td>进一步降低 Send Rate</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>自适应控制的目标是在<strong>网络条件恶化时优雅降级</strong>，而不是固定按最差情况设计（那样好网络的玩家体验也被拖累）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>带宽优化是让服务器从&quot;只能支撑 10 个玩家&quot;扩展到&quot;支撑 100 个玩家&quot;的关键技术栈。多级压缩流水线（AOI→Delta→量化→位打包→熵编码）每层都有独立的压缩收益，叠加后实现数十倍压缩。自适应带宽控制让系统在网络恶化时优雅降级而非崩溃。发送频率与 Tick Rate 的解耦提供了额外的调优自由度。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"protocol-design\">协议设计</a>定义了数据包结构中承载压缩数据的位置；<a href=\"latency-compensation\">延迟补偿</a>说明了历史快照缓冲区的存储需求与 Delta 编码的关系。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"带宽优化","id":"带宽优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"带宽预算分析","id":"带宽预算分析"},{"level":2,"text":"Delta 压缩","id":"delta-压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"兴趣区域管理（AOI）","id":"兴趣区域管理-aoi"},{"level":2,"text":"量化与位打包","id":"量化与位打包"},{"level":2,"text":"快照压缩流水线","id":"快照压缩流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"发送频率与插值缓冲","id":"发送频率与插值缓冲"},{"level":2,"text":"自适应带宽控制","id":"自适应带宽控制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"延迟补偿（服务器端）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking/latency-compensation"},"next":{"title":"部署与热修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/operations/deployment-hotfix"}}